WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:03.461
There is overwhelming support for FGLI
students at Yale.

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:07.674
Something that surprised me
is really the collaborative community.

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:09.426
Going to office hours, having lunch

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:11.469
with your professor,
learning more about their interests.

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.596
I've been surprised by how easy it is

00:00:13.596 --> 00:00:17.434
to make connections here with professors
or even administrators.

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:21.271
For me, the greatest experience was
the First-Year Scholars at Yale program.

00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:23.523
We come to New Haven for six weeks.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.567
You take an English course
and a math course.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:27.819
It's very helpful
for someone who came from a background

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:29.779
where we didn't have calculus
in high school.

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:32.115
We want students to realize
that there are a lot of students

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:34.534
from very similar backgrounds
to themselves here on campus.

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:36.411
An example of that
is actually just community dinners

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:38.455
that we host
at the start of each semester.

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:41.499
You have a mental health and counseling
services to go and just like

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.502
talk about things you overcome,
why you're proud of yourself,

00:00:44.502 --> 00:00:47.380
what frustrates
you and it really validates your feelings.

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:49.632
I studied abroad in London.

00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:53.053
It really shaped
kind of what I wanted to do in post-grad.

00:00:53.136 --> 00:00:56.806
It was completely funded by Yale.
I'll be studying abroad in Japan

00:00:56.806 --> 00:00:58.349
and this upcoming semester.

00:00:58.349 --> 00:01:03.063
The only way I'm able to do it is because
Yale has wonderful financial aid.

00:01:03.271 --> 00:01:06.691
Everybody is really here to support you
and get you through your four years here.

